<title>NETHERLANDS: Ahold's Schuitema 96 net rises 3.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Ahold's Schuitema 96 net rises 3.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZAANDAM, Netherlands 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schuitema NV, a 73 percent owned wholesaling unit of Dutch supermarkets group Ahold NV said on Wednesday net earnings rose to 45.3 million guilders in 1996 from 43.6 million in 1995.  </p>
<p>Schuitema said earnings per share rose to 188.85 in 1996 from 181.65 in 1995.</p>
<p>Dividend rose to 75.00 guilders per share from 72.50 in 1995.</p>
<p>The group's turnover gained to 3.185 billion guilders in 1996 from 3.062 billion guilders in 1995.</p>
<p>Operating profit slipped to 56.1 million guilders in 1996 from 58.9 million in 1995, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
